{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The UnderMind</strong> is an atmospheric indie horror set in an abandoned underground bunker. After a catastrophic accident, terrifying creatures have broken free, and survival is now in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last remaining operator, you must:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage the generator</strong> \u2014 distribute or cut power across different sections of the base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the doors</strong> \u2014 stop monsters from breaching restricted zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep your sanity</strong> \u2014 small, twisted creatures slowly gnaw away at your mind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice matters. Do you keep the lights on to see what\u2019s coming, or conserve power to last the night?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the shadows, outsmart the escaped monstrosities, and uncover what truly lurks <strong>under the mind</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022320?t=1758912818","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022320?t=1758912818","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022320/0021e21f120638a92491181863aba0f3bd3f6f1e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758912818","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022320/0021e21f120638a92491181863aba0f3bd3f6f1e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758912818","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The UnderMind</strong> is an atmospheric indie horror set in an abandoned underground bunker. After a catastrophic accident, terrifying creatures have broken free, and survival is now in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last remaining operator, you must:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage the generator</strong> \u2014 distribute or cut power across different sections of the base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the doors</strong> \u2014 stop monsters from breaching restricted zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep your sanity</strong> \u2014 small, twisted creatures slowly gnaw away at your mind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice matters. Do you keep the lights on to see what\u2019s coming, or conserve power to last the night?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the shadows, outsmart the escaped monstrosities, and uncover what truly lurks <strong>under the mind</strong>.</p>","developers":["Lonwayli Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022320/54fcb2b7ebf8a26bbb3127f0f7299c404ac9ecff/header.jpg?t=1758912818","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022320/790411570/d7339cfc0d8892e8001c60016834c36f2ae2a412/1757778458/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758912815","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022320/790411570/d7339cfc0d8892e8001c60016834c36f2ae2a412/1757778458/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758912815","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022320/790411570/d7339cfc0d8892e8001c60016834c36f2ae2a412/1757778458/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758912815","id":257197327,"mp4":{"480":"h